Z||000003||Jefrysuko||07-18-2001||10:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Phil:<BR><B>A bad ground will do odd things like that.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Could anyone tell me where to look for the gound on that side?||||reg||1
Z||000004||Uaana||07-18-2001||11:40 AM||||The grounds for the front end are in the headlight wells. Pretty easy to spot two wires and a bolt on the fender side and they have a tendency to get a bit corroded.||||reg||1
