Z||000006||Jefrysuko||07-18-2001||10:31 PM||||Ok guy's<P>I cleaned up the ground wires and checked to bulbs and everything seams good to go.  Now when I turn on the turn signal all the lights that are supposed to flash come on and stay on.  Then when I turn on the parking lights everything on that corner goes dead again.  <P>I want to try and get the wiring harness disconected from the firewall (right next to the master cylinder).  That way I can apply voltage to a certain light and make sure that everything is right with that part of the harness.  I however cannot figure out how to get it disconected.  Anyone know how to do this one?||||reg||1
